class="math inline">→</span> <em>ʾemar</em>; <em>ḥ-z-y</em> <span
class="math inline">→</span> <em>ḥzā</em>), they still behave
syntactically like normal verbs.</p>
<p><strong>5-Question Warm-Up Drill</strong></p>
<p><em>(Answers in Section 9)</em></p>
