<question type="description"><name><text>Module 2 · Lesson 8 · Section 5: The Subjunctive Flow</text></name><questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<h3>Section 5: The Subjunctive Flow</h3>
<p>Observe how the purpose clause flows in translation:</p>
<div class="tablewrap"><table>
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 33%" />
<col style="width: 33%" />
<col style="width: 33%" />
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: left;">Primary Action (Past/Present)</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">Subjunctive Clause (d- + Imperfect)</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">Translation</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">ʾEtā malkā (The king came)</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">d-neqṭūl l-eh (that he might kill
him)</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The king came in order to kill him.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">Yūḥannan ʿābed nūhrā (Yukhannan makes
light)</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">d-neḥzūn ʿammā (that the people might
see)</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Yukhannan makes light so that the people
will see.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<hr />

]]></text></questiontext></question>
<question type="multichoice"><name><text>Module 2 · Lesson 8 · Check 7</text></name><questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[The construction <i>d-</i> + imperfect corresponds to which Greek construction?]]></text></questiontext><generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[]]></text></generalfeedback><single>true</single><shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers><answer fraction="100" format="html"><text><![CDATA[<i>ἵνα</i> + subjunctive (purpose)]]></text><feedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[Correct: 'in order that...'.]]></text></feedback></answer><answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[The aorist indicative]]></text><feedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[That matches the perfect.]]></text></feedback></answer><answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[The genitive absolute]]></text><feedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[Not this.]]></text></feedback></answer><answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[The articular infinitive]]></text><feedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[Not this.]]></text></feedback></answer></question>
<question type="description"><name><text>Module 2 · Lesson 8 · Section 6: Vocabulary (Time, Judgment &amp; Royal Court)</text></name><questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<h3>Section 6: Vocabulary (Time, Judgment &amp; Royal Court)</h3>
